    "title": "Kids Korner: April 30 to May 7, 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Heidi Sutton ,\n17 hours ago Sweetbriar Nature Center, 62 Eckernkamp Drive, Smithtown presents First Steps Into Nature for children ages 2 to 4 on May 1 and May 8 at 9:30 a.m. Little ones will learn about nature through hands on interaction, music, crafts, stories, play and more. $20 per child per class. To register, visit www.sweetbriarnc.org. 631-979-6344. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
